Senpai... It's good!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:53.490
With this, I'm sure onii-chan will gladly glue his eyes on senpai!

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:55.160
Really?

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:57.790
I'll do my best, Iroha-dono!

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.140
That's the spirit!

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:01.310
I wish you luck!

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:04.230
Then...

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:07.050
See you tomorrow, Inuzuka-kun.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.720
OK. See you.

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:17.710
Kuzuryuu-san?

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.050
Class rep...

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.000
What a coincidence...

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.100
At a place like this...

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:27.050
Thank you for looking after Koushi-dono...

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.940
While being friendly with him...

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:30.570
Huh?

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:36.380
Everyone says it's like you guys are going out.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.080
That's a misunderstanding.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:44.230
I'm aware that you don't know about my relationship with Koushi-dono.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.230
However...

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:46.490
"However"?

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:49.970
I have to make this clear to you!

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:52.480
Koushi-dono and I are...

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.720
...engaged!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:58.950
Under one roof...

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:04.380
Though inexperienced, Koushi-dono and I are doing our best to put our love at test everyday.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.990
Yet, you are destroying everything!

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:12.200
You are swaying people from their path.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:15.210
People like you would get kicked by a horse and die!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.440
Don't you understand!?

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:18.320
Horse...

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.430
That's not my intention...!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:23.880
Then swear right here!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.710
That you would not go near Koushi-dono from now on.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:27.900
Hurry up!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.060
Uh...

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:32.140
Kuzuryuu-san, please calm down.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.900
Don't try to fool me!

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:35.340
No...

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:38.480
I'll take that as a no.

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:41.370
Th... That's not what I...

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:42.810
Class rep.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:48.590
Sorry, I forgot to return the notebook to you.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.570
Hmm? Momoko?

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.450
What are you doing here?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.240
Inuzuka-kun...

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.540
What is it? Let go.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.610
I won't, absolutely.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.250
Hey, stop fooling around.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:06.140
Geez... What are you embarrassed about? It's not like you.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.960
Now, like always, passionately...

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:11.790
What are you talking about?

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.170
Let go of me already.

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:15.840
It's working.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.910
If she can give up like this...

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.330
Moreover...

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.020
I feel so happy...

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.060
I want to stay like this forever...

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.350
Forever like this...

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:33.580
Koushi-dono~

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:35.780
I've come to pick you up.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.490
It can't be...

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.720
No way...

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.950
There are two of me...

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.640
What's going on?

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.750
That's what I want to ask!

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:51.880
What's going on here!?

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:54.990
Who are you!?

00:16:56.340 --> 00:17:01.110
Note: "Senpen Hyakumen Sousho" literately means "the disguise of a thousand transformations and a hundred faces".

00:16:56.340 --> 00:17:01.110
The secret technique of Indara Jaei Genma style, the skill of Senpen Hyakumen Sousho...

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:04.470
I could get rid of the four eyes with just a little more time...

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:05.980
What do I do...?

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.430
I have to get out of this situation...

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.130
But I don't want to let go...

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.700
No! No! No, Iroha!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.400
Onii-chan belongs to Momoko senpai.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:19.700
Get away from Koushi-dono, you fake!

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:21.430
Who...?

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.180
Who is real...?

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.970
N... No...

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:27.830
Onii-chan, onii-chan...

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:29.590
I don't want to let go...!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:30.720
Sis...

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:32.160
What are you doing!?

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.540
Get out of there!

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.190
It hurts.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.000
Eh?

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.040
I said it hurts.

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:42.210
Let go of me, you fake.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.730
You can't be Momoko.

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:49.780
You should know about my injuries if you are real.

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.910
And you would not grab onto me.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:54.990
That's especially true, considering Momoko's personality.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.870
Koushi-dono...!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:00.200
The fact that you are the fake is as clear as the sky above us.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.860
Who are you!?

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:04.500
Could she be another assassin?

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:06.640
That's not it...

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.900
Denial would only make you look more suspicious!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.150
Prepare yourself!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.630
Haira Ichiden Musou style, ultimate technique!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:18.060
Translation: The strike that can exterminate the spirits of the dead.

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:17.620
Shadow Crusher!

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.270
Wa... Wait...!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.730
Sis...

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.840
Who was her?

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:32.190
Koushi-dono, I'm touched!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.700
You knew I'm the real one.

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:38.030
You are pretty bold too, but that fake...

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:41.640
...lacked your gentleness.

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:43.090
I thought it's kinda weird.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.760
Koushi-dono, thank you!

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:46.980
Thank you!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.390
I got it already.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.530
Let go of me, don't stick onto me.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.250
Si... Sis...

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.760
What's with the injuries...?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.890
No... It's nothing.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:02.550
I kinda tripped...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.500
It's not Momoko senpai's fault...

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.360
The one at fault is...

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:09.330
Let's go.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.200
Iroha-dono...

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:16.020
Uh...

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.400
Are you okay?

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.980
Go on ahead.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:21.610
I'm alright.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:22.930
But...

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.370
No buts!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.880
If you don't hurry...

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:27.610
Mmm...

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.250
Four eyes...

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:40.950
To take my revenge...

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:41.610
Sis!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.420
Again!?

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:53.540
That woman...

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.590
She dodged my attacks by sneezing.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.980
This kind of coincidence can't happen twice.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:03.490
At least we know that she's not a normal school girl.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:04.940
Could she be a martial artist?

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.320
I hate to believe it...

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:10.620
But if her family name contains a character from the twelve zodiacs...

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.480
Nakajima.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:16.740
Note: The first character of "Nakajima" means "middle", and the second character means "island".

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.740
It doesn't contain any character from the twelve animals.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.750
Is it just my imagination?

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.790
Hey, you two.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:24.210
What are you sneaking around for?

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.130
Welcome...

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:29.770
You have something to tell me, right?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.560
Four eyes! So you have revealed your true self!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.600
What pressure!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.480
She's at a different level!

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:50.210
You bitch...

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:52.030
Who are you!?

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.680
La... Landlord...

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.530
Why do you look so surprised?

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:10.020
Thanks for coming, you are here to pay the rent, right?

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.320
Sorry to disturb you!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:14.130
Sorry!

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.420
Hey! Leave your rent behind!

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:17.710
Your rent!

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.110
That was scary! That was so scary!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.150
Why was the landlord there!?

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.560
Let's just run!

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.350
Grandma?

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:28.540
Oh, Sanae.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.460
It was the martial artists living in our apartment.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.590
What a fuss...

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.500
I see...

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.610
Those people...

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:37.080
As I thought...

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:42.010
Note: These three characters are also pronounced as "Nakajima", and the last character means "horse".

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:40.440
No...

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:45.500
So they are martial artists too.

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:47.470
Just like me...

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:17.240
You are unconcerned even when my adoration for you has been shaken.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:17.240
kogareta omoi wo butsukete mo anata wa suruusuru

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:17.240
焦がれた想いをぶつけてもアナタはスルーする

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:21.490
Words alone can't express it.

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:21.490
kotoba dake ja tsutawaranai no

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:21.490
言葉だけじゃ伝わらないの

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:28.310
Maybe I should change my hair style to with frill and lace and attack again.

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:28.310
kamigata wo kaete furiru to reesu de semeyoukana

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:28.310
髪型を変えてフリルとレースで攻めようかな

00:22:29.170 --> 00:22:34.310
Where is the one-hit-for-the-kill ultimate technique?

00:22:29.170 --> 00:22:34.310
ichigeki hisatsu no ougi wa izuko ni

00:22:29.170 --> 00:22:34.310
一撃必殺の奥義はいずこに

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:38.790
Love is not a game.

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:38.790
koi wa geemu ja nai kedo

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:38.790
恋はゲームじゃないけど

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:43.070
With victory at stake, LET'S MAKE LOVE TONIGHT.

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:43.070
shoubu wo kakete LET'S MAKE LOVE TONIGHT

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:43.070
勝負をかけて LET'S MAKE LOVE TONIGHT

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:48.620
Embracing you, or being embraced.

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:48.620
dakiatte dakishimerarete

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:48.620
抱き合って抱きしめられて

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:52.110
The flame of love is burning up.

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:52.110
ai no honoo ga moeagaru no sa

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:52.110
愛の炎が燃え上がるのさ

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:56.730
The moon light on our first night.

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:56.730
hajimete mukaeru yoru no tsuki akari

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:56.730
初めて迎える夜の月明かり

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:59.540
Shining, and shining.

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:59.540
terasarete terasarete

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:59.540
照らされて照らされて

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:03.240
What should I do when our eyes meet?

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:03.240
mitsume au toki dou sureba ii no

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:03.240
見つめ合う瞬間どうすればいいの

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:06.400
Let's settle this with rock, paper, scissors.

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:06.400
guu choki paa de shinkenshoubu na

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:06.400
グー チョキ パーで真剣勝負ね

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:08.310
I'll give it my all.

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:08.310
honki dashimasu

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:08.310
本気出します

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:12.750
In the next episode of Sumomomo Momomo...

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:16.260
It's the story about "the heroine of a tragic love".

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:18.840
I'll give it my all.
